      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEIL THE SEAL (6) looked strong on debut August 12 at this track over 525m (30.56) when boxed wide. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. One of the contenders. KIWI LISMORE (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Ballarat behind Kiss For Cash (25.77) in a Maiden. Has the pace to be prominent. Expected to feature. UNIQUE CROWN (2) is a debutante for the Jason Sharp kennel and profiles well for first outing. Among the main hopes. STIDHAM KANSAS (4) is a Korie-Lee Heinrich-trained newcomer by Allen Deed out of Jd Elegant. Start all important from the squeeze box. Can run a bold race on debut.",
